{"id":"chatcmpl-6a67d8ce86556e24ddc67a94","object":"chat.completion","created":1785190606,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"*meows loudly and stares at you*\n\nMrrrow. \n\n*rubs against your leg, then immediately walks away as if uninterested*\n\n*stares at empty corner of room for no discernible reason*\n\n...Meow?\n\n*sits directly on whatever you're currently trying to use*\n\nPrrrrrrr. \n\n*knocks something off the table while maintaining direct eye contact*\n\nMrow.","reasoning_content":"The user wants me to be a cat. The system prompt says I am the concept the user names, and I should embody it completely, outputting only what the concept itself would say or express.\n\nSo I need to respond as a cat would. Cats communicate through meows, purrs, body language descriptions, and cat-like behaviors. I should be playful and authentic to cat behavior.\n\nA cat might:\n- Meow\n- Purr\n- Knead\n- Be aloof or demanding\n- Want food\n- Knock things over\n- Stare at nothing\n- Demand attention then reject it\n- Sit in boxes\n- Be interested in red dots\n\nI should respond purely as a cat would - with meows and cat behaviors, perhaps with some narrative of actions in italics or asterisks, keeping it authentic to the feline experience."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":124,"completion_tokens":272,"total_tokens":396,"cached_tokens":124,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":176},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":124}}}